phi-adapter-deco (0.1.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * First release: TP-Link Deco mesh over the main Deco's local web API
    (RSA + AES envelope, one admin round per poll, pinned certificate),
    nodes as gateways, clients through the SDK 0.29 ClientTracker with
    pairing style Listing, WLAN block as the network access switch.

